# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The shooter's colours.  Cool hull, hot exhaust, grey rock: the three
# families are what let the ship, its flame and a meteor be told apart
# at a glance, and a palette that keeps them apart will read at arm's
# length whatever the individual colours are.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

